SignInCommand -[hidden]down- ResetPasswordCommand
RequestPasswordResetCommand -[hidden]down- SeedRolesCommand
AuthenticationController -[hidden]down- SignUpCommandFromResourceAssembler
UsersController -[hidden]down- SignInCommandFromResourceAssembler
UserResourceFromEntityAssembler -[hidden]down- IamContextFacade
AuthenticatedUserResourceFromEntityAssembler -[hidden]down- IamContextFacade
IamContextFacade -[hidden]down- UserCommandServiceImpl
IamContextFacade -[hidden]down- RoleCommandServiceImpl
UserCommandServiceImpl -[hidden]down- UserQueryServiceImpl
RoleCommandServiceImpl -[hidden]down- UserQueryServiceImpl
UserQueryServiceImpl -[hidden]down- HashingService
UserQueryServiceImpl -[hidden]down- TokenService
